# This vault is private by default. Only explicitly whitelisted files
# (README.md, plus repo-level dotfiles below) are tracked in git — every
# personal note, daily log, clipping, and Obsidian/plugin config stays local.

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...but allow traversal into every directory so whitelisted files
# nested inside them can still be found...
!*/

# ...and allow README files at any depth.
!README.md

# Keep the repo's own tracking files.
!.gitignore
